project (total_sum, i_category, i_class, lochierarchy, rank_within_parent)
└─ top-sort [lochierarchy desc, __sort_0 asc, rank_within_parent asc] limit 100
   └─ project (total_sum, i_category, i_class, lochierarchy, rank_within_parent, __sort_0)
      └─ window partition=[wk_0, wk_1] order=[sum_0 desc] fns=[w_0=rank]
         └─ project (__grouping_id__, item.i_category, item.i_class, sum_0, wk_0, wk_1) (rows≈3 cost≈9.4K)
            └─ aggregate keys=[item.i_category, item.i_class] aggs=[sum_0=sum] (rows≈3 cost≈9.2K)
               └─ project (item.i_category, item.i_class, web_sales.ws_net_paid) (rows≈1 cost≈9.1K)
                  └─ join inner [item.i_item_sk = web_sales.ws_item_sk] emit-filter 1 from right (rows≈1 cost≈9K)
                     ├─ source item AS item use-filter 1 keys=[item.i_item_sk] (rows≈10 cost≈360)
                     └─ join inner [d1.d_date_sk = web_sales.ws_sold_date_sk] (rows≈1 cost≈4.5K)
                        ├─ filter (&& (<= 1212 |d1.d_month_seq|) (<= |d1.d_month_seq| (+ 1212 11))) (rows≈1 cost≈160)
                        │  └─ source date_dim AS d1 row-groups (&& (<= 1212 |d1.d_month_seq|) (<= |d1.d_month_seq| (+ 1212 11))) (rows≈10 cost≈80)
                        └─ source web_sales AS web_sales (rows≈10 cost≈160)
